<title>USA: Rexene to offer 101 pct for senior notes.</title>
<headline>Rexene to offer 101 pct for senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privately-held Huntsman Corp, which agreed last week to acquire Rexene Corp, said Monday that under the terms of the merger agreement, Rexene will purchase all $175 million of its 11.75  percent senior notes, due 2004,  at 101 percent  of the aggregate principal amount plus accrued and unpaid interest to the date of purchase.</p>
<p>Huntsman said at this time it has no intention to take any other action, including a tender offer, to redeem the notes.</p>
</text>
